    <Notes>Pokémon Puzzle Collection is a collection of different puzzle games such as: Shadow Puzzle, where different shapes are put together to make an image of a Pokémon; Motion Puzzle, a sliding game where an image of a Pokémon has to be unscrambled; Escape, where one has to move blocks to let a Pokémon out of a maze; and a bonus for completing most of your Minidex is the game Power On, a ‘Pipe Dream’-like game where one has to connect a Pikachu to a light bulb, creating a circuit.</Notes>
